      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Hey, Emily! That's great to hear. What do you plan for your day? I bet it's super busy and exciting. As for me... well, I'm actually not sure what to say. How about we meet up and catch up over coffee sometime? My treat!",
